{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Renters paying 30%+ of income",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Share of renter households spending 30% or more of income on gross rent \u2014 the federal definition of rent-burdened \u2014 pale mauve to deep magenta. Measured over all 437 districts with a published value: 7 classes with breaks at 45%/48%/50%/55%/58%/60%, which fall at the 14th/33rd/48th/77th/89th/95th percentile of the national distribution.",
